  "interaction": {
    "inputMethod": "NavigationSubmitEvent on actual native UI Toolkit Buttons, explicit synthetic account/auth/native/read/write gates and retained preference controls; no physical-touch claim",
    "steps": [
      "the actual native Account controller loads the authenticated cloud copy without a write",
      "upload double tap sends one strict compare-and-set body and confirms its exact readback",
      "upload preserves unrelated cloud keys and merges the higher cloud/device star value",
      "download reads the current cloud copy and only raises device stars without a provider mutation",
      "a committed upload with a lost response is verified by readback without a second send",
      "a cloud version conflict blocks another upload until an explicit fresh review",
      "refresh after a conflict reads the provider copy before another approval",
      "an export for a different player cannot reach the file sink",
      "export storage failure never reports a saved file",
      "successful review export reaches only the memory sink and rapid taps produce one export",
      "the privacy button uses the configured API origin and review intercepts the external open",
      "the web deletion button retains the existing public deletion route",
      "privacy completion reports form closure without claiming a changed consent choice",
      "native privacy failure remains visible and makes no consent claim",
      "native volume controls clamp correctly at both ends",
      "all supported native preference toggles and the battle layout apply to the running session",
      "delete review is separate from the destructive provider write",
      "keeping the account cancels deletion without a write",
      "refresh invalidates the old deletion approval and requires a new review",
      "malformed cloud data disables writes while local sign-out remains available",
      "privacy options remain reachable during a failed account data refresh",
      "an empty cloud copy is explicit and cannot be downloaded as invented progress",
      "the first cloud copy uses compare-and-set version zero and exact readback",
      "a late cloud download cannot merge the previous account stars into this device",
      "an old account export cannot reach storage after adopting another account",
      "same-account authorization rotation fences an old cloud reply before any device merge",
      "the visible final deletion review can be canceled without any provider write",
      "switching accounts invalidates the earlier destructive approval",
      "a committed old deletion receipt cannot clear the new identity or run Google sign-out for it",
      "lost deletion response stays unconfirmed and never retries or clears a session on assumption",
      "only the matching deletion receipt clears the approved session and reports confirmation",
      "sign-out ends local authority before the server revocation response arrives",
      "an old logout completion cannot erase or forget the newly adopted identity",
      "local sign-out succeeds during network loss without claiming server revocation",
      "leaving the sign-in screen cancels a delayed Google result before adopting it",
      "failed native sign-in does not invent an authenticated account",
      "a failed API token exchange remains visible after its own auth revision advances",
      "a late API token exchange cannot adopt its old identity over a newer session",
      "successful isolated sign-in adopts one identity and finishes with truthful refreshed status",
      "final 4:3 account navigation remains within the frame with at least 64-reference-pixel targets"
    ],
